{"id": "86198", "name": "שינוי נושא נוסחה – y = √(x² + 4), בידוד x חיובי (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Rearrange the following and make \\(x\\) the subject of the formula.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} = {{CT:1}}. \\]</p><p>You may assume that \\(x>0\\) in this question.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(x\\) = [[input:ans]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-root\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:left\">How to enter: a square root as <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(...)</code>, e.g. <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(5*x)</code>. Other roots as a power, with brackets around the exponent: \\(\\sqrt[3]{x+1}\\) is entered as <code dir=\"ltr\">(x+1)^(1/3)</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> To rearrange formulae perform operations to both sides of the formula to obtain an equation with \\(x\\) as the subject.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Square both sides</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} = {{CT:1}}. \\]</p>First, square both sides of the equation to remove the square root:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:2}} = {{CT:3}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Subtract \\(4\\)</b><br>Subtract 4 from both sides:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:4}} = {{CT:5}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Take the square root (\\(x>0\\))</b><br>Take square roots of both sides:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:6}} = {{CT:7}}. \\]</p>Now you have an equation for \\(x\\).</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["ta"], "nvariants": 1}